The Complete Lojban Language, by John Woldemar Cowan

The Lojban reference grammar, a complete description of the Lojban grammar, with index, reference-quality hardbound, 660 pg. $39 + shipping as follows (book orders and shipping costs are independent of all other orders, and do not count towards large order discounts)

